Configure durable encrypted OAuth state and stable signing/encryption material based on baseline findings, preserving root discovery/DCR and view resource compatibility. Specify storage permissions, backup, key rotation, and restart behavior. Do not assume local FastMCP defaults match deployment or replace encryption with plaintext storage. Acceptance: access and refresh survive new process construction with persistent state; corrupt/missing state and rotation errors are controlled; focused regression tests.
